    "toc_article_FKA4Ri": {
      "type": "toc-article",
      "blocks": {
        "chapter_9gKj6e": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. Introduction",
            "text": "<p>This Cookie Policy explains how Handel (Ningbo) Electronic Commerce Co., Ltd., trading as PB Fulfill, uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit:<br/><br/>https://pbfulfill.com<br/><br/>In this Cookie Policy, “PB Fulfill,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to Handel (Ningbo) Electronic Commerce Co., Ltd.<br/><br/>This Cookie Policy should be read together with our Privacy Policy:<br/><br/>https://pbfulfill.com/pages/privacy-policy<br/><br/>Our Privacy Policy explains more broadly how we collect, use, disclose, store, and protect personal information.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_WfnLfY": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. What Are Cookies?",
            "text": "<p>Cookies are small text files that a website places or stores on your browser or device.<br/><br/>Cookies can allow a website to recognize a browser or device, remember information about a visit, provide essential functions, understand website performance, and support analytics or marketing activities.<br/><br/>Some cookies are deleted when you close your browser. These are commonly called session cookies.<br/><br/>Other cookies remain on your browser or device for a defined period or until you delete them. These are commonly called persistent cookies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_qc9fga": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Similar Technologies ",
            "text": "<p>In addition to cookies, we and our service providers may use similar technologies, including:</p><p> </p><p>• Pixels;</p><p>• Tags;</p><p>• Web beacons;</p><p>• Local storage;</p><p>• Software development kits;</p><p>• Device identifiers;</p><p>• Embedded scripts; and</p><p>• Other technologies that store or access information on a browser or device.</p><p> </p><p>In this Cookie Policy, references to “cookies” generally include these similar technologies where appropriate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_jGbkBc": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Why We Use Cookies ",
            "text": "<p>We may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p><p> </p><p>• Operate our website;</p><p>• Provide essential website functions;</p><p>• Maintain website security;</p><p>• Prevent fraud and misuse;</p><p>• Remember your preferences;</p><p>• Support forms and account functionality;</p><p>• Understand how visitors use our website;</p><p>• Measure website and page performance;</p><p>• Identify technical errors;</p><p>• Understand how visitors reached our website;</p><p>• Measure marketing or campaign performance where enabled; and</p><p>• Personalize content or marketing where permitted.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_PXNrmJ": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Categories of Cookies We Use ",
            "text": "<h3>5.1 Necessary Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Necessary cookies support essential website functions and cannot generally be disabled through our cookie preference controls.</p><p> </p><p>They may be used to:</p><p> </p><p>• Load and display website pages;</p><p>• Maintain website and network security;</p><p>• Prevent fraud and malicious activity;</p><p>• Remember privacy and cookie choices;</p><p>• Support account login;</p><p>• Maintain a shopping cart or checkout session where applicable;</p><p>• Process forms;</p><p>• Balance website traffic; and</p><p>• Provide other functions that are necessary for the website or a service requested by the user.</p><p> </p><p>Disabling necessary cookies through your browser may cause parts of the website to stop working correctly.</p><p> </p><h3>5.2 Preference Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Preference cookies allow the website to remember choices that affect how the website operates or appears.</p><p> </p><p>They may be used to remember:</p><p> </p><p>• Language;</p><p>• Country or region;</p><p>• Display settings;</p><p>• Previously selected options; and</p><p>• Other website preferences.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, we will request consent before using non-essential preference cookies.</p><p> </p><h3>5.3 Analytics Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Analytics cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website.</p><p> </p><p>They may collect information about:</p><p> </p><p>• Pages visited;</p><p>• Time spent on pages;</p><p>• Links and buttons clicked;</p><p>• Referring pages or sources;</p><p>• Browser and device type;</p><p>• Approximate location;</p><p>• Website errors;</p><p>• Page performance; and</p><p>• General visitor and session trends.</p><p> </p><p>We may use this information to improve website performance, content, navigation, and user experience.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, analytics cookies will be used only after you provide consent.</p><p> </p><h3>5.4 Marketing Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Marketing cookies may be used where advertising or campaign-measurement services are enabled.</p><p> </p><p>They may help us or our service providers:</p><p> </p><p>• Measure the effectiveness of campaigns;</p><p>• Understand whether a visitor completed an inquiry or other conversion;</p><p>• Associate website visits with marketing sources;</p><p>• Limit repeated advertising;</p><p>• Build or measure audiences;</p><p>• Provide more relevant marketing; and</p><p>• Understand interactions across websites, applications, or devices where permitted.</p><p> </p><p>Marketing cookies may be placed or accessed by third-party advertising and marketing providers.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, marketing cookies will be used only after you provide consent.</p>"
          }
        },
